=== K4: the matching condition -- the one quantitative output of the reading ===
  F2 with rho_* = rho_m(z_f):   a_0 = kappa * c * sqrt(G rho_m(z_f)),   rho_m(z) = rho_m,0 (1+z)^3
  => required freeze-out redshift per footing (kappa = 1/2):
       1 + z_f = ( rho_ref / (Omega_m rho_crit,0) )^{1/3}
  and the inverse trade:
       kappa(z_f) = a_0 / (c sqrt(G rho_m(z_f))) = (1/2) * ( rho_ref/rho_m(z_f) )^{1/2}

