=== K5: the two routes that set the scale from the halo itself, graded on universality ===
  R-A (internal-acceleration route). BTFR v_f^4 = G M_b a_0 with M_b = f_b M_vir, plus virial v_f^2 = G M_vir/R_vir:
        a_0 = f_b^(-1) * G M_vir / R_vir^2
      with M_vir = (4 pi/3) Delta_v rho_crit(z) R_vir^3  =>  a_0 = f_b^(-1) (4pi/3)^(2/3) Delta_v^(2/3) G M_vir^(1/3) rho_crit^(2/3)
  R-B (catchment-saturation route). Settled region exhausts the catchment, R_set = R_c with M_b = (4 pi/3) R_c^3 rho_b:
        a_0 = f_cdm^2 (4 pi/3)^(2/3) G M_b^(1/3) rho_b^(2/3)
