=== K6: the cosmic-budget closure (reported, VACUOUS) ===
  Integrated over a volume V:  total phantom = f * rho_b * V  and  f := Omega_c/Omega_b (a definition).
  The cosmic supply is  Omega_c rho_crit V = f * (Omega_b / Omega_m) * Omega_m rho_crit V = f * rho_b V.
  Identity: total phantom - supply = 0   for every f, rho_b, V -- it contains no kappa.
  K6: VACUOUS. Not used for a label.

